# linear-issue/pi/body 160x45 @44,13 (72x28)
╭─ Linear draft ───────────────────────────────────────────── Close × ─╮
│                                                                      │
│   E  Honor Retry-After when the sync worker backs off after a 429    │
│                                                                      │
│   ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│   The sync worker doubles its delay after every `429` and never      │
│   reads `Retry-After`, so it retries sooner than the shop API        │
│   allows and gets limited again.                                     │
│                                                                      │
│   - Read `Retry-After` (seconds or an HTTP date) from the `429`      │
│   response                                                           │
│   - Wait at least that long, then go back to the doubling delay      │
│   - Cap the wait at `MAX_DELAY`                                      │
│                                                                      │
│   **Where:** `src/sync.sh`, `src/config.sh`                          │
│                                                                      │
│   **Done when:** a `429` with `Retry-After: 30` makes the worker     │
│   wait 30 seconds before its next try.                               │
│                                                                      │
│                                                                      │
│                                                                      │
│                                                                      │
│                                                                      │
│                                                                      │
